erride": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le04ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, the week is finally over.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: TGIF! What an emotional week. I'm drained!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Me too! That we both managed to get through some difficult situations is amazing!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's important is that we learned something from our experiences. We both learned that we need to use our emotional intelligence to gauge others' emotional states and then react appropriately.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le04ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span></span>: I could have used this information earlier, but better late than never! It's something we can continue to work on, isn't it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, it would've been great to be aware of ways to improve communication with people. What's frustrating is that apparently not many people seem interested in working on this part of their personalities.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, we are, and for that we deserve a reward! What should we do this weekend to relax?", "id": 2, "time": "26000", "image": "engenn9le04ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A friend at work told me that she was going to get a massage. What would be great would be to spend the day immersed in luxury in a spa.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Great idea! We should have made a reservation. You could have gotten a massage and pedicure. I would have gotten a facial. And I told you that I would pay the next time we went to the spa.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Now I'm disappointed that we didn't think of this sooner. My friend said she had really enjoyed this spa.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll book it for next week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can't wait!", "id": 3, "time": "52500", "image": "engenn9le04ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le04ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le04ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}